         MACRO
         LINEND
.*                            THIS MACRO IS USED ONLY BY THE LINE
.*                                 MACRO TO SET THE NUMBER OF ENTRIES
.*                                 ASSOCIATED WITH EACH LINE.
         GBLA  &NRENTS
         GBLC &NRENTSX
         AIF   (&NRENTS EQ 0).NORENTS   TEST FOR NO COUNT
         ORG   &NRENTSX
         DC    FL1'&NRENTS'
         ORG
&NRENTS  SETA  0
.NORENTS ANOP
B&SYSNDX EQU   *
&NRENTSX SETC  'B&SYSNDX'
         MEND
